[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "胞子の流れを探知。さらに西の方角",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Spore trail detected. Moving further west."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう。さあ、急ぐわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good. Come on, let's move!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待ちな！\u3000なんだ、この強烈な「気」は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on! What is that... that overwhelming presence..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000胞子量の減少を確認。\n誰かが、魔物を倒している？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Spore count dropping. Someone is defeating the monsters?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イヤ……これは……この気配は……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No... this is... I know this presence...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぬら、我に胞子を浴びせるとは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You dare shower me in spores..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このキノコども、我を支配できるとでも思ったか！\n愚か者めが！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did you mushrooms actually think you could control me?! Fools!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゼロ姉……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嘘だろ……キノコ相手にここまでやる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way... they went this far against a bunch of mushrooms?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゼロ、なにしに来たのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero, what are you doing here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "決まっておろう。ヤドヴィガ、キューン、\nうぬらを連れ戻しに来たのじゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isn't it obvious? I've come to bring Jadwiga and Quinn back."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたたちじゃ凶暴すぎるのよ。\n二人の面倒は私が見る。だから、帰ってもらうわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're better off without you around. I'm looking after them now. So go home!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう？\u3000皆がそう言っておると？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? And everyone agrees with that, do they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、そうよ。当たり前じゃない！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Obviously!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ。パルメ族の使命を忘れたというのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga. Have you forgotten your duty to the Palme?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……否",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...No."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうなんじゃ？\nヴァレリアが言っていることは、本当かのう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well? Is what Valeria saying... true?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は……わた、し……は……ここ、に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... I... I want to... stay here..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やめて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何様のつもりじゃ？\u3000ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who do you think you are, Jadwiga?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン。正直な気持ちを、求める",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn. Tell us how you truly feel."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫。私がいる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It is all right. I am here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここに、いたい……ここにいたいよおっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to stay here... I want to stay here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……承知。ならば",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Understood. Then—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューンの笑顔を、私は守る。\n私も、ここに残る！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I will protect Quinn's smile. I am staying too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "抜かしおる……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You dare...!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、よく言ったわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well said, both of you!"
        }
