      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアああああ！\u3000皆を誑かしおって！\nお仕置きじゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria! You've led them astray! Time for your punishment!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……！\u3000\nやっぱり、力が違いすぎる……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...! She's just too strong...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……やめて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Stop."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあああ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haaaaah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "があっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aaagh!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア姉ちゃんを傷つけないで！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't you hurt her!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぬっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wha—!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ、はあ……私だって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah... hah... I'm not just..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "守られてばかりじゃない……みんなを、守るんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm not just someone who gets protected... I protect people too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私……分かったんだ。\n誰かを守りたいって思ったとき、力が湧いてくるの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I finally understand. When I want to protect someone... that's when my strength comes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だってきっと、それが私の存在意義だから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because that's why I exist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "面白い！\u3000うぬのその覚悟……しかと見せてみよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Interesting! Show me that resolve of yours — for real!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン、右へ回避！\u3000次は上から！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn, dodge right! The next attack comes from above!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふははは！\u3000良いぞ、良いぞ！\u3000\nならば、こちらも少し本気でいくぞ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha! Yes, yes! Now we're talking! Let's see how you handle me going all out!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「九偉人」の２番目。戦うことが大好き。\n兄のヘルトと共に、世界を見て回っている途中",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The second of the Miraculous Nine. Lives to fight. Currently traveling the world alongside her brother Held."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
